+# Consolidated P0/P1 closure register
+Baseline: verify latest main, production aliases and migration history before changes. Last directly checked at 11:09 UTC: PR 162 build READY (2b7fbaca), both domains still on PR 158 (cca5908). Recheck rather than assuming current state. User screenshots previously confirmed Jadeed save/publish. No complete functional acceptance yet.
+
+| ID | Priority | Action | Required implementation | Acceptance |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| VC01 | P0 | KEEP/MODIFY | Reuse companies.id; migrate legacy company_sectors and company_locations ownership to canonical ID with audited mappings | Admin-created and owner-created records save/reload; no cross-tenant access |
+| VC02 | P0 | MODIFY | Reuse master_data_items and geo_areas/geo_aliases; stable parent/child IDs and reviewed synonyms; do not infer missing sectors | Valid hierarchy, duplicate prevention, inactive records retained |
+| VC03 | P0 | MODIFY | Universal countries, Pakistan default, city-first, Karachi main city, optional district/tehsil, international region/city/postcode, Google Maps links | Pakistan/UK/UAE round-trip across relevant modules; no forced Pakistani subdivisions |
+| VC04 | P0 | MODIFY | Company classification multi-sector/subsector/activity using shared master; separate brand, breed, species, disease, generic | Admin/customer create/edit parity; legacy text retained until reviewed mapping |
+| VC05 | P0 | MODIFY | Secure owner/company-scoped drafts and staged uploads, conflict versioning, idempotency, atomic writes or recoverable partial saves | Refresh, failed submit, session expiry, repeated fields, two-account isolation |
+| VC06 | P0 | MODIFY | Role-specific verification, separate publication and approval, optional NTN and appropriate foreign evidence | No approval bypass, no private evidence leakage, PVMC rules preserved |
+| VC07 | P0 | MODIFY | Consistent record actions: edit/update, publish/unpublish where applicable, archive/restore, dependency-checked audited delete | Authorized actions only; no destructive production testing; preserve historical records |
+| VC08 | P0 | REMOVE FROM DISPLAY | Hide raw IDs, audit actor IDs, storage URLs, internal tags, private contacts from public views and ordinary admin presentation; authorized audit panel only | Public response and export allowlists; direct URL and RLS tests |
+| VC09 | P1 | MODIFY | Company directory centered original logos, company name, sector chips, short tagline, read more, consistent cards; reuse PR162 | Phone/tablet/desktop, no full description, individual filters |
+| VC10 | P1 | MODIFY | All public profiles and admin/customer forms use shared typography, spacing, labels, responsive layout; remove duplicate buttons and unnecessary internal marketing copy | Visual route matrix, no sticky overlap, no horizontal overflow |
+| VC11 | P1 | ADD/INTEGRATE | Global search with approved public projections, sector/alias and exact disease matching, entity tabs, location filters, indexed pagination | Poultry returns relevant entities; unrelated vaccines excluded; no unpublished/private matches |
+| VC12 | P1 | MODIFY | Master data add/edit/deactivate, reviewed suggestions, dedupe/merge/relink, audit; retain stable IDs | Permissions, parent validation, no orphan relationships |
+| VC13 | P1 | MODIFY | Jobs, clinics, labs, professionals, students, owners, products, CV and reporting integrate only relevant shared fields | Per-module create/edit/search/print tests; product origin not duplicate company address |
+| VC14 | P1 | MODIFY | Performance: indexed measured queries, bounded server pagination, lightweight assets, optional map links without initial embeds | Compare query plans, requests, mobile load and bundle |
+| VC15 | P0 | VERIFY | GitHub exact-head CI, isolated DB migration rehearsal, rollback, production alias configuration and release controls | Tests and build pass, explicit acceptance, both aliases verified |
