+All items remain OPEN/PARTIAL unless evidence is recorded. PRs 159–162 are partial implementation, not universal closure. Alumni separate future issue #150. Clinical workflow #80 must be scoped against actual existing implementation; no fake completion. Main issues: #96, #132, #114, #101, #80. Preserve current branding, AdSense, approved profiles, routes and security. No duplicate source files or per-module master tables without justification.
